o  the carpet  this is lubricating the carpet for the  drill brush which massages the soap into  the fibers  an extractor vacuums out any leftover  debris and moisture  to ensure there's no mold regrowth the  surface has to dry completely  [Music]  already  is a house cleaner who works with sticky  and oily stains  here she's cleaning a dirty kitchen  she starts by scraping any large chunks  off of the top of the stain  lime scale stains are usually caused by  minerals in water  they leave white calcium and red rust on  surfaces  these stains require an acidic cleaner  like vinegar or citric acid  softer stains like grease oil and coffee  are usually sticky for those she uses an  alkaline solution like bleach oven  cleaner or baking powder  ari typically prefers oven cleaner over  bleach since it's less harsh  you
 

